mland-atlas/pennsylvania/lancaster-county"],["ARC or PLC in Lancaster County","/arc-plc/pennsylvania/lancaster-county"],["PRF calculator","/prf"]],"story":"<p class=\"prf-lede prf-story\">As of Oct 12, the record here runs 75 years, 1951 to 2025, on the middle value of the county&rsquo;s 12 grids. September to October came in under 90% of normal in 36 of those years. In 2025, January to February came in at 55% of normal on the middle of the grids, and May to June at 171%. So far in 2026, May to June sits at 62% of normal on the middle of the grids.</p>"}
